# Domain reminder (Cloudflare / DNS)

Canonical production host is **https://maddysfoundation.org**.

When the user asks about **Cloudflare**, **DNS**, or the custom domain for this project:

1. DNS (Cloudflare preferred) should point at Vercel project `maddys-foundation`.
2. Vercel Domains: `maddysfoundation.org` + `www` (www → apex).
3. **Required:** `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://maddysfoundation.org` on Production (and Preview if absolute OG should match).
4. Redeploy after env changes so `metadataBase` / Open Graph use the real domain.
5. `lib/site-metadata.ts` should prefer `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`, then production → `https://maddysfoundation.org` (no vercel.app fallback for prod).
6. Smoke-check: `https://maddysfoundation.org/opengraph-image` and home `og:url` / `og:image`.
